Pigsty Python Faker backport
============================

This recipe keeps the minimal runtime-only packaging model originally based on
Ubuntu Noble's faker 22.0.0-1 source package:

  https://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/faker/22.0.0-1

It now uses the official Faker 40.37.0 tag archive unchanged.  The recipe keeps
the pybuild packaging model but builds only python3-fake-factory, which is the
runtime package required by postgresql-*-faker.  The separate faker CLI package
and upstream's large optional pytest stack are intentionally omitted from this
runtime-only backport.  Faker 40.37.0 requires Python 3.10 or newer and no
longer requires python-dateutil at runtime.

The Makefile permits builds only on bookworm and jammy and appends the suite to
the Debian version.  Trixie, Noble, and Resolute must continue to use their
distribution packages.
